{"license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kindertransporten: 'Joodse kinderen in kamp Vught' - Interview 01, LOTTY HUFFENER-VEFFER"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:56123"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. Klijn"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NIOD"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M.C.C. Huffener"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M.C.C.  Huffener"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Lotty Veffer Foundation"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Lotty (Charlotte) Huffener-Veffer is geboren *10-7-1921 in een niet-gelovig Joods gezin in Amsterdam-Oost. Ze wordt diamantsnijdster van beroep, net als veel andere Joodse meisjes. Op 11 februari 1943 wordt het gezin Veffer van huis gehaald en naar kamp Vught gedeporteerd.<br>Lotty Huffener verblijft ruim anderhalf jaar in kamp Vught waar de nazi’s een diamantfabriek willen opzetten. Haar ouders en zusje Carla worden met het beruchte Kindertransport van 7 juni 1943 naar Sobibor weggevoerd. Lotty wil mee, maar mag dat niet van haar moeder.<br>In Vught werkt Lotty voor Philips. Na een kort verblijf in Auschwitz komt ze in Reichenbach terecht, waar ze voor Telefunken moet werken. Aan het eind van de oorlog wordt Lotty samen met vele duizenden anderen gedwongen deel te nemen aan een dodenmars. Vanaf de periode in Vught is Lotty samen met een groep jonge vrouwen die elkaar er doorheen slepen. De terugkeer na de bevrijding ervaart ze als haar zwartste tijd; er is niemand meer en ze staat er helemaal alleen voor.<\/p><p>Thema’s:<br>(Joods) leven voor de oorlog<br>Begin van de oorlog, verwachtingen<br>Razzia's<br>Kamp Vught<br>Kindertransport<br>Auschwitz<br>Werkkamp<br>Dodenmars<br>Na de bevrijding, terugkeer<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2014-01-16"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Deze collectie Kindertransporten: 'Joodse kinderen in kamp Vught' bevat zeven interviews (2003) waarin mensen die de kampen overleefden, het verhaal vertellen van de kinderen en van zichzelf. In 2007 werden hiermee een aantal korte (educatieve) documentaire's gemaakt: <\/p><p>2 documentaires<br>- 'Wat kunnen ze nou met ons doen?', korte educatieve documentaire, gebaseerd op dit interview en de interviews met Koos Valk, Kitty Wurms-Andriesse, Lotty Huffener-Veffer.<br>JKKV_2007_WAT_KUNNEN_ZE_NOU_MET_ONS_DOEN<br>- 'Als ik later groot ben' is een documentaire in drie delen, gebaseerd op dit interviews en de interviews met Koos Valk, Kitty Wurms-Andriesse, Lotty Huffener-Veffer, Jules Schelvis, Anny Sulzbach, Jacques en Dave Furth.JKKV_2007_ALS_IK_LATER_GROOT_BEN<\/p><p>4 korte montages<br>- 'Moeder en kind', het verhaal van Anny Sulzbach<br>JKKV_2007_Moeder_En_Kind_Sulzbach<br>- 'Het kind dat moest onderduiken', het verhaal van Jacques en Dave Furth<br>JKKV_2007_Het_Kind_Dat_Moest_Onderduiken_FURTH<br>- 'Eindpunt Sobibor' , het verhaal van Jules Schelvis<br>JKKV_2007_Eindpunt_Sobibor_SCHELVIS<\/p><p>Impressie<br>'Het kindermonument', impressie uit 2006 van de jaarlijkse Herdenking van de Kindertransport uit Vught, 6 en 7 juni 1943.<br>JKKV_2007_GEDICHT_LAPLACESTRAAT<\/p><p>Intro<br>JKKV_2007_intro<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Na de bevrijding"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Razzia"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Razzia’s"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kindertransport"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Leven voor de oorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dodenmars"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Telefunken"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Omstanders"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Afscheid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Overleven"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Jodenster"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Davidster"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Appel"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Aufseherin"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"hygiëne"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wassen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Philips Kommando"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Douche"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tatoeage"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getatoeerd nummer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Temperaturen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vrouwenvriendschap"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vriendschap"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Rode Kruis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Opvang"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bezittingen geroofd"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Gezin"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ziekte"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Honger"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vrouwen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bevrijding"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Herdenking"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Typhus"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Verwerking"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Beppie Schuier"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tineke Wibaut"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Diamantsnijdster"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Salomon Tukkie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Graaf Folke Bernadotte"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dokter Steijns uit Utrecht, vrouwenarts"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"(Joods) leven voor de oorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Begin van de oorlog"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Vervolging"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Verwachtingen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Terugkeer"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Telefunken"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","English","Polish"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2003-01-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. Bohnen (regisseur en producent, Jules Bohnen Media)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A. Bakker (historicus, redacteur documentaires, samensteller samenvattingen)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. de Moei (research)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-01-17"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-01-16"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["In september 1999 werd op het terrein van het herdenkingscentrum Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught een gedenkteken voor het Kindertransport naar Sobibor geplaatst. Op dit kindermonument staan alle namen en leeftijden van de 1269 kinderen die niet overleefden. Ter gelegenheid van de plaatsing van het monument schreef Janneke de Moei het boek ‘Joodse kinderen in het kamp Vught’.\nHet kindermonument maakt grote indruk. Janneke de Moei en Mirjam Huffener constateerden dat er behoefte was aan goed en eigentijds educatief materiaal. Zij richtten met Jules Schelvis de werkgroep ZART (verbonden aan de Stichting Sobibor) op. \n\nJanuari 2003 realiseerde deze werkgroep acht interviews van elk 2 uur afgenomen met nabestaanden van deze kindertransporten.\n\nDeze interviews werden gebruikt om een driedelige documentaire te maken ‘Als ik later groot ben’. Deze documentaire werd later opgenomen in een dvd met diverse korte en langere documentaires, behorend bij een lesdoos die in 2007 gerealiseerd werd.\nKern van de lesdoos is de korte documentaire (17 minuten) geschikt voor VMBO t\/m VWO: “Wat kunnen ze nou met ons doen?” Deze uitspraak is afkomstig van een van de geïnterviewde ooggetuigen. Het typeert de verbazing van de geassimileerde Nederlandse Joden die, gelovig of niet-gelovig, een normaal leven leidden totdat ze uit de samenleving werden verbannen. \n\nHet verhaal van het Kindertransport is in 2011 belicht in de vorm van een expositie. Deze reizende tentoonstelling kreeg de titel: ‘Alle kinderen, ze zijn weg’ en werd op 5 juni 2011 in Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught geopend."]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["NIOD Institute for War, Holocaust and Genocide Studies"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Yes"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geesteswetenschappen"},{"lang":"en","value":"Humanities"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"History"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/213a59ea-8d36-42c6-b30b-474ebbdef61d","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-46